INPUT
  attachments verified against request.json sha256: spec.md, dataset.json.gz, dataset.csv -> 3/3 match
  dataset.csv parsed as semicolon-delimited UTF-8; all 9 required columns present
  53,867 data records parsed. request params report rowCount 53,873, which counts raw newlines;
